    "title": "Tampa Cops Answer Intruder Call, Find Gator on Late-Night Swim - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elizabeth Johanson ,\n13 hours ago The late-night \"intruder\" reported at a Tampa home on March 29 was not a burglar at all. Officers who answered the call instead found a very Florida-style uninvited guest: a live alligator that had apparently let itself in for a solo swim. Neighbors were shaken but unharmed, and the whole scene was captured on video the department later shared. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
